WEBVTT

00:04:57.961 --> 00:05:02.251
If we want to break up Big Ag's hold
on our food supply chain,

00:05:02.275 --> 00:05:05.546
then we're going to need
to connect with our farmers.

00:05:05.993 --> 00:05:08.457
We're going to need
to rebuild relationships

00:05:08.481 --> 00:05:11.704
with the hands that feed us
three times a day.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.448
Plus, two more for snacks.

00:05:15.465 --> 00:05:16.641
Come on.

00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:23.121
With a government online database
of more than 8,600 farmers markets

00:05:23.145 --> 00:05:24.310
across the country,

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:26.670
you can easily find
the nearest one to you.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.436
Just think of yourself
as an investor in food,